      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, tres dioses recorrían el mundo: Odín, Loki y Hœnir.",
          "en": "One day, three gods went walking through the world: Odin, Loki, and Hoenir."
        },
        {
          "es": "Odín era el jefe de los dioses. Loki era el embaucador. Hœnir era un dios calmado y callado.",
          "en": "Odin was the chief of the gods. Loki was the trickster. Hoenir was a calm, quiet god."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llegaron a un río con una cascada, y tenían hambre.",
          "en": "They came to a river and a waterfall, and they were hungry."
        },
        {
          "es": "En la orilla había una nutria comiendo un salmón con los ojos cerrados.",
          "en": "On the bank sat an otter, eating a salmon with its eyes closed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Loki lanzó una piedra y la mató. Estaba orgulloso: ¡un solo tiro, y dos comidas!",
          "en": "Loki threw a stone and killed it. He was proud: one throw, and two meals!"
        }
      ],
