      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Esa noche, los dioses pidieron refugio en una granja. Era de un hombre llamado Hreidmar.",
          "en": "That night, the gods asked for shelter at a farm. It belonged to a man named Hreidmar."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hreidmar era un poderoso hechicero. Los dioses le mostraron orgullosos la piel de la nutria.",
          "en": "Hreidmar was a powerful wizard. The gods proudly showed him the otter's skin."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hreidmar gritó horrorizado. No era un animal salvaje. Era su hijo Ótr, que nadaba en el río convertido en nutria.",
          "en": "Hreidmar cried out in horror. That was no wild animal. It was his son Otr, who swam in the river as an otter."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llamó a sus otros hijos, Fáfnir y Regin. Entre todos atraparon a los dioses y los ataron.",
          "en": "He called his other sons, Fafnir and Regin. Together, they seized the gods and tied them up."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mataron a mi hijo, dijo Hreidmar. Ahora pagarán, o morirán.",
          "en": "You killed my son, said Hreidmar. Now you will pay, or you will die."
        }
      ],
